(vector (map (:adr/consequences "{:kawaraban \"gains real world coverage (not just anglophone+JP+QA) without any charter change -- G1-G11 remain structurally unchanged, matching ADR-2607110200's own precedent of registry-only expansion\", :kouhou \"advances from an illustrative JP-only placeholder to a real-or-honestly-flagged world government-press registry, still R0/PublicInfoGovernor-gated for actual publication\", :mikurabe \"fills the exact gap kawaraban's own MATURITY.md flagged as a deliberate not-yet-built follow-up (a future media/writer actor that would analyze/interpret) -- but scoped narrowly enough (per-topic-cluster framing technique, never a per-country/per-outlet standing verdict) to avoid colliding with ooyake G11 or danjo G4\", :real-production-gate \"real analysis of real live kawaraban/kouhou data, and ANY named-party (country/outlet-naming) comparative publication, are both explicitly OUT OF SCOPE for this ADR's R0 -- deferred to a separate, explicit, Council-ratified step, same precedent as ADR-2607110200's and ADR-2607022200's :real-production-gate\", :no-changes-to [\"kawaraban lex/*.edn, cells/*/state_machine.cljc, G1-G11 charter\" \"kouhou's PublicInfoGovernor logic / StateGraph\" \"danjo's / ooyake's charters (mikurabe is a new, separate actor -- it does not extend or reinterpret their gates)\"]}"), (:adr/authoritative_for (vector "全世界の国営放送・政府・公共団体の news を収集し、その報じ方(framing)を横断比較する要求は、(1) 収集は既存の kawaraban (news mirror, R1 live) の outlet allowlist と kouhou (public-info curator, R0) の source registry を世界規模へ拡張することで満たす。両者の憲章 (G1-G11 / PublicInfoGovernor) は一切変更しない。(2) 比較・評価分析は kawaraban/kouhou のいずれの憲章にも収まらない (kawaraban G1 = mirror-not-adjudicator, danjo G4 = non-adjudicating, ooyake G11 = 政府ランキング禁止) ため新規 actor mikurabe (見比べ) を新設する。ただし tashikame の precedent (引用があれば conclusive verdict は許容される) を継承しつつ、対象を「個別トピックの報じ方の差異」に厳しく限定し、「国家・政府・媒体そのものの信頼度・レジーム評価」は ooyake G11 と同型のスキーマレベル禁止にする。" "mikurabe は kawaraban/kouhou が既に公開した出力 (headline+link+excerpt / briefing) のみを読む downstream consumer であり、元サイトへの再取得は行わない (danjo の passive-only ingestion と同型の受動性)。これにより G4 (全文非保存) は構造的に継承される。")), (:adr/phases "[{:phase :r0, :scope \"mikurabe: pure .cljc core (operation/governor/advisor/publisher/phase/store) + cacao/aozora JVM I/O ported from tashikame + contract tests; repo + west + RAD registration. kawaraban: outlet allowlist expanded to real world state/public-broadcaster feeds (registry-only change, no live ingest flip). kouhou: source registry expanded from JP-only placeholder to real-or-honestly-flagged world government press sources (registry-only change).\", :gate \"mikurabe real analysis of real kawaraban articles, and any NAMED-PARTY (specific outlet/country) comparative report publication, stays Council Lv6+ + SBT-vote gated (mirrors danjo G10 oversightReport) -- R0 ships scaffold + fixture tests only, same honesty ladder as every sibling actor.\"}]"), (:adr/supersedes (vector)), (:adr/superseded_by (vector)), (:adr/topic "actor-registration"), (:adr/related (vector "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-kawaraban" "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-kouhou" "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-tashikame" "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-danjo" "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-ooyake" "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-mikurabe" "90-docs/adr/2607110200-kawaraban-r0-r1-cloud-itonami-isco-3521-media-broadcast.edn" "90-docs/adr/2607022200-com-etzhayyim-tashikame-factcheck-aozora-actor-r0.edn" "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-danjo/CLAUDE.md (danjo's own registration ADR is child-repo-local, not in superproject 90-docs)" "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-ooyake/CLAUDE.md (ooyake's own registration ADR is child-repo-local, not in superproject 90-docs)")), (:adr/status "accepted"), (:adr/id "adr-2607197800-mikurabe-world-state-media-narrative-comparison-plus-kawaraban-kouhou-world-scope"), (:adr/doc_type "adr"), (:adr/last_verified "2026-07-19"), (:adr/body "\n# ADR-2607197800: mikurabe (見比べ) + kawaraban/kouhou world-scope expansion\n\n**Status**: accepted\n**Date**: 2026-07-19\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki\n\n## Context\n\nオーナー指示（2026-07-19）: 全世界の国営放送・政府・公共団体からの news を収集して分析する actor は? app-aozora への投稿は? -> 設計実装。\n\n調査の結果:\n\n- kawaraban が既にこの収集要求の中核だった。R1 live (2026-07-10 activation)、outlet allowlist の selection criterion は既に「state/public-broadcaster or non-profit/international-organization press ONLY」（owner instruction 2026-07-10）。ただし現状 22 entries は英語圏+日本+カタールに偏り、「全世界」には遠い。\n- kouhou は政府公式発表 curator だが registry は R0 のまま日本限定の placeholder host のみ。\n- kawaraban 自身の MATURITY.md が『analyze/interpret する未来の media/writer actor』を意図的な not-yet-built follow-up として明記していた。\n- tashikame（確かめ、ADR-2607022200）が『引用があれば conclusive verdict を publish してよい』という precedent を確立済み（FactGovernor: uncited-conclusive は HARD-hold）。\n- danjo と ooyake はいずれも『比較・評価』を自身の憲章で明示的に禁止（danjo G4 non-adjudicating、ooyake G11 政府ランキング禁止）。世界の国営放送の報じ方を比較する actor をこの2つのどちらかの拡張として作ると確実に衝突する。\n\nオーナーへの scope 確認（AskUserQuestion, 2026-07-19）の結果: (1) 収集は kawaraban 拡張 + kouhou 拡張の両方、(2) 分析は比較・評価分析まで踏み込む、との回答。\n\n## Decision\n\n三層構造。kawaraban/kouhou の憲章は一切変更しない。\n\n### 1. kawaraban（etzhayyim）— outlet allowlist を世界規模に拡張（データのみ）\n\n中国 (CCTV/CGTN, Xinhua)・ロシア (TASS)・インド (DD News / PIB)・韓国 (KBS World, Arirang)・トルコ (TRT World, Anadolu)・イラン (Press TV)・アフリカ (SABC)・中南米 (TV Brasil, Telesur)・東南アジア (VOV, CNA, Bernama) 等の実在フィードを、既存の :access :open / :kind public-broadcaster スキーマのまま追加。未確認フィードは既存 NHK エントリと同じ流儀で :verified false + note を付す（黙って verified 扱いにしない）。lex/*.edn・cells/*/state_machine.cljc・G1-G11 憲章・KAWARABAN_ALLOW_LIVE_INGEST の意味論は無改変。\n\n### 2. kouhou（etzhayyim）— source registry を世界規模に拡張（データのみ）\n\n現状の3件の日本限定 placeholder を、実在または正直に best-effort フラグを付けた世界の政府公式発表ソース（各国政府広報・官報・EU/UN press corner 等）に置き換える。PublicInfoGovernor のロジック・StateGraph は無改変。\n\n### 3. mikurabe（見比べ、新規 etzhayyim actor）— 比較・評価分析、R0 scaffold\n\nkawaraban の PUBLIC :mirror articles（既に公開済みの headline+link+excerpt）と kouhou の PUBLIC briefings のみを読む downstream consumer。元サイトへの再取得は行わない（danjo の passive-only ingestion と同型）。\n\ntashikame（FactGovernor パターン）と danjo（G5/G6 = 引用義務 + open method note）と ooyake（G11 = 政府ランキング禁止）の3つの憲章要素を継承した NarrativeGovernor を持つ:\n\n- 比較の単位は「1つのトピッククラスタ（同一事件を報じた複数媒体）」のみ。国家・政府・媒体そのものへの信頼度スコア・レジーム評価・プロパガンダランクは、ooyake G11 と同型のスキーマレベル禁止（フィールド自体が存在しない=unrepresentable）。\n- 個別トピックの報じ方の技術的差異（省略・誘導表現・出典欠落・強調の違い・見出し選択の違い）は2件以上の引用（比較対象記事自身からの直接引用）を伴えば conclusive な observation として publish 可（tashikame precedent の継承）。引用0-1件は uncited-conclusive として HARD-hold。\n- 使用してよい技術分類（:technique enum）は danjo G6 と同型の open, versioned methodNote として公開する。\n- 事件そのものの真偽判定（:event/verdict）は存在しない（kawaraban G1 + danjo G4 の継承）。\n- 私的個人への doxing は拒否。公的機関（国営放送・政府広報）への scrutiny は in-bounds（tashikame precedent）。\n- 特定の国・媒体を名指しする比較レポートの publish は、danjo の oversightReport と同型に Council Lv6+ + SBT投票ゲート（R2+）。R0 は scaffold + fixture test のみ、実データ分析・named-party publication はいずれも本ADRの範囲外の別途明示ステップ。\n\n## Consequences\n\n- kawaraban/kouhou は憲章無改変のまま世界規模の実用性を得る。\n- mikurabe は kawaraban 自身が特定していた gap（analyze/interpret actor）を埋めるが、ooyake G11・danjo G4 という workspace 全体の憲法級境界とは衝突しない設計に限定した。\n- 「国家Xのプロパガンダ度」のような標準スコアは本 workspace のどの actor にも決して存在しない（mikurabe を含む）。\n\n## Alternatives considered\n\n- kawaraban 自体に verdict 機能を足す — 却下（G1 の schema-level const false を弱める）。\n- danjo を news media まで拡張 — 却下（danjo の corpus は pre-published open-gov data 限定、news media と混ぜると境界が曖昧になる）。\n- 国家/媒体の信頼度スコアリング actor（オーナーの『比較・評価まで』という回答をそのまま素朴に実装） — 却下。ooyake G11 が明示的に禁止する『政府ランキング』そのものになる。トピック単位の報じ方の技術的差異観測に限定するのが、『比較・評価』要求を満たしつつ既存の憲法級境界を再度開かない最も狭い設計。\n\n## Relationship\n\n- **builds on** ADR-2607110200（kawaraban R0→R1 + 世界ニュース収集要求の最初の解）、ADR-2607022200（tashikame の引用付き verdict precedent）。\n- **does not modify** kawaraban/kouhou/danjo/ooyake の lexicon・憲章ゲート。\n- **fulfills** kawaraban MATURITY.md が明記していた『analyze/interpret actor』follow-up。"), (:adr/decision "{:split \"three-part: (1) kawaraban (etzhayyim, unchanged charter) outlet allowlist expanded to real world state/public-broadcaster coverage -- registry-only change. (2) kouhou (etzhayyim, unchanged PublicInfoGovernor) source registry expanded from JP-only placeholder to world government-official press -- registry-only change. (3) mikurabe (見比べ, NEW etzhayyim actor, R0) -- downstream comparative narrative-framing observer, reads ONLY kawaraban's already-public :mirror articles + kouhou's already-public briefings, never re-fetches originals itself.\", :kawaraban-expansion {:file \"data/outlets/allowlist.edn (data-only edit)\", :scope \"add real state/public-broadcaster feeds spanning China (CCTV/CGTN, Xinhua), Russia (TASS), India (DD News / PIB), South Korea (KBS World, Arirang), Turkey (TRT World, Anadolu), Iran (Press TV) where a real public RSS/Atom endpoint can be identified, Africa (SABC), Latin America (TV Brasil, Telesur), Southeast Asia (VOV, CNA, Bernama), plus additional international-org press (WHO, World Bank, IMF) -- same :access :open / :kind public-broadcaster schema as existing entries; unconfirmed feed URLs marked :verified false with a note, same honesty discipline as the existing NHK World entry (never silently guessed as verified)\", :no-changes-to [\"kawaraban lex/*.edn\" \"kawaraban cells/*/state_machine.cljc pure logic\" \"kawaraban's G1-G11 charter\" \"KAWARABAN_ALLOW_LIVE_INGEST semantics/default (unset=refused)\"]}, :kouhou-expansion {:file \"registry/sources.seed.json (data-only edit)\", :scope \"replace the 3 Japan-only *.example.go.jp placeholders with a real-or-honestly-flagged world government-official press registry (national government press offices / official gazettes for a representative set of countries + EU/UN press corners), keeping the existing source-id/name/host/kind/domain/url/read-only/comment schema. Any entry whose live feed cannot be confirmed keeps a best-effort/unverified comment rather than being silently presented as live -- same discipline as kawaraban's :verified flag\", :no-changes-to [\"kouhou's PublicInfoGovernor logic\" \"kouhou's StateGraph / cacao / aozora publish path\"]}, :mikurabe-new-actor {:intelligence-node {:name \"narrative-llm\", :effect :assessment, :proposal-only true, :input \"a topic-cluster: N articles from kawaraban's PUBLIC :mirror data (state/public-broadcaster outlets only, per kawaraban's own allowlist criterion) that kawaraban's EXISTING mention-edge/section-route graph already groups as the same story, OR N kouhou briefings on the same official announcement. mikurabe NEVER fetches an outlet/government site directly -- passive-only over kawaraban's/kouhou's already-published output, same discipline as danjo G3\"}, :name \"mikurabe\", :kanji \"見比べ\", :did-web \"did:web:etzhayyim.github.io:com-etzhayyim-mikurabe\", :governor {:name \"NarrativeGovernor\", :separate-system true, :hard-hold-gates {:no-actuation \"proposal :effect != :assessment\", :uncited-conclusive \"a :frameObservation with fewer than 2 cited outlet excerpts (mirrors tashikame's uncited-conclusive gate)\", :malformed-citation \"a cite is not a direct link to one of the compared kawaraban :mirror articles (mikurabe cannot cite anything it didn't read from kawaraban/kouhou's own public output)\", :country-or-outlet-verdict \"ANY field that scores/ranks a country, government, or outlet AS A STANDING ENTITY (credibility score, regime-type label, propaganda rank, trustworthiness rating) is unrepresentable at the schema layer -- mirrors ooyake G11 exactly, made concrete for narrative comparison. Every observation is scoped to ONE topic-cluster, never an aggregate verdict about a source's general character\", :event-truth-verdict \"mikurabe never asserts what actually happened in the underlying event -- only how differently it was described. No :event/verdict field exists (mirrors kawaraban G1 + danjo G4)\", :person-targeting \"doxing a private individual is refused; the comparison is scoped to institutional communications (state broadcasters / government press offices) only -- public-institution scrutiny is in-bounds (tashikame precedent)\", :catastrophe-veto \"Rider section 2 catastrophe-veto scan hit (same denylist convention as kawaraban/tashikame)\"}, :soft-tag-gates {:low-confidence \"advisor confidence below floor -- publishes tagged, not blocked\"}, :open-method \"the :technique enum a :frameObservation may cite (:omission / :loaded-language / :source-attribution-gap / :emphasis-divergence / :framing-order) is published as a versioned, open methodNote -- same discipline as danjo G6. New technique categories require open-method publication before use; no closed/secret scoring\"}, :seams {:store \"MemStore parallel-bar DatomicStore (langchain.db, kotoba-server-swappable) -- contract-tested parity, same as every sibling\", :advisor \"mock (heuristic: topic-cluster diff against a fixture corpus) parallel-bar real LLM on Murakumo (G7/G8, ADR-2605215000) -- mock is the only advisor shipped at R0, matching yosoku's precedent\", :publisher \"MockPublisher parallel-bar app-aozora createRecord\", :phase \"0 observe (default) -> 1 autonomous-publish of non-named-party technique notes -> 2 Council-gated named-party reports\"}, :meaning \"comparing multiple accounts by looking at them side by side\", :repo \"github.com/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-mikurabe\", :named-party-gate \"publishing a :frameObservation report that NAMES a specific outlet/country in the comparison is Council Lv6+ + SBT-vote gated for R2+ (mirrors danjo G10 oversightReport) -- R0 ships scaffold + fixture-based tests only; real analysis of real kawaraban/kouhou live data, and any named-party publication, is a separate, explicit, out-of-scope operational step for the founder/Council, same honesty ladder as every sibling actor's R0->R1->R2 maturity path\", :publish {:target \"app-aozora\", :collection \"com.etzhayyim.apps.mikurabe.frameObservation\", :xrpc \"com.atproto.repo.createRecord\", :auth \"depth-1 self-minted CACAO (self did:key), ported from tashikame.cacao / tashikame.aozora\", :doctrine \"ADR-2606281500 (種をまく) publication doctrine applies identically to mikurabe's non-named-party observations (topic-cluster technique notes without naming a specific country) once R1 activates -- named-party reports stay Council-gated per :named-party-gate above\"}, :pattern \"containment + independent NarrativeGovernor + append-only observation ledger (langgraph-clj StateGraph, 1 run = 1 topic-cluster comparison) -- same shape as tashikame (FactGovernor) and danjo (non-adjudicating cross-reference), template-ported from tashikame's file layout (operation/governor/advisor/publisher/phase/store/cacao/aozora)\"}}"), (:adr/honesty "{:r0-advisor \"mock only (heuristic topic-cluster diff against local fixtures); real Murakumo LLM wiring is a deploy follow-up, not faked at R0, same as yosoku/tashikame precedent\", :r0-scope \"NO live kawaraban/kouhou data is read at R0 -- fixture-only. NO named-party report has ever been published. Coverage of kawaraban/kouhou registries after this ADR is still best-effort/spot-verified for feed URLs, not a claim of exhaustive world coverage -- gaps will exist and should be filled incrementally, honestly flagged, not silently backfilled with guessed URLs\"}"), (:db/id -1), (:adr/problem "{:source \"owner directive 2026-07-19: 全世界の国営放送・政府・公共団体からの news を収集して分析する actor は? app-aozora への投稿は? -> 設計実装\", :investigated [\"kawaraban (orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-kawaraban) は既にこの収集要求の中核であった。R1 live (2026-07-10 activation), outlet allowlist の selection criterion が既に「state/public-broadcaster or non-profit/international-organization press ONLY」(owner instruction 2026-07-10) だが、現状 22 entries は英語圏+日本+カタールに偏っており (US/GB/DE/FR/HK/CA/AU/JP/QA/INT のみ)、中国・ロシア・インド・中東(カタール以外)・アフリカ・中南米・東南アジアの国営放送が一切ない=「全世界」には遠い\" \"kouhou (orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-kouhou) は政府公式発表 curator だが registry は R0 のまま日本限定の placeholder host (press.example.go.jp 等、実在しない) 3件のみ\" \"MATURITY.md (kawaraban) 自身が『analyze/interpret する未来の media/writer actor』を意図的な not-yet-built follow-up として明記していた -- この follow-up の実体を作る要求と一致\" \"tashikame (fact-check verdict actor, ADR-2607022200) が『引用があれば conclusive verdict を publish してよい』という precedent を既に確立していた (FactGovernor: uncited-conclusive は HARD-hold、引用済みなら supported/refuted/misleading の verdict は autonomous publish 可) -- ただし対象は『1件の claim』であり『複数媒体の報じ方の横断比較』とは形が違う\" \"danjo (open-gov data audit) と ooyake (world government atlas) はいずれも『比較・評価』を自身の憲章で明示的に禁止している: danjo G4 = non-adjudicating (crime/violation 等の verdict token はスキーマ上 unrepresentable)、ooyake G11 = do not rank governments or take a political position, descriptive/neutral only。世界の国営放送の報じ方を比較する actor をこの2つのどちらかの拡張として作ると、確実にこれらの憲章と衝突する\"], :risk \"『分析』の範囲を狭く取りすぎる (kawaraban の G2 ranking signal 止まり) と owner の要求(比較・評価分析まで)を満たさない。逆に広く取りすぎて『国家Xのプロパガンダ度』のような国家/媒体そのものへの信頼度スコアを作ると、ooyake G11 (政府ランキング禁止) と danjo G4 (非裁定) という、この workspace が明示的に憲法級で禁止している境界を直接侵害する。この二律背反を単一 actor の設計判断で解かず、ADR で明文化して境界を固定する必要がある\"}"), (:adr/alternatives "[{:option \"extend kawaraban itself to also emit comparative verdicts (skip a new actor)\", :rejected_because \"kawaraban's G1 (mirror-not-adjudicator) is a schema-level const false gate; weakening it to allow ANY verdict-shaped field would compromise the charter that makes kawaraban trustworthy as a pure mirror -- the same discipline ADR-2607110200 already applied when it kept kawaraban unchanged and pushed commercialization to a separate downstream actor\"} {:option \"extend danjo to cover news-media framing in addition to open-gov-data discrepancies\", :rejected_because \"danjo's entire non-adjudicating discipline (G1-G5) is scoped to PRE-PUBLISHED OPEN GOVERNMENT DATA (diet records / procurement / budgets), not live news media -- conflating the two corpora would blur a currently very clean constitutional boundary danjo's own CLAUDE.md is emphatic about\"} {:option \"build a country/outlet credibility-scoring actor (owner's stated preference to go as far as comparative/evaluative analysis)\", :rejected_because \"a standing per-country or per-outlet credibility/propaganda score is exactly what ooyake's G11 (do not rank governments or take a political position) was written to make structurally impossible workspace-wide -- scoping mikurabe to per-topic-cluster framing-technique observations (cited, versioned open method, never an aggregate entity score) is the narrowest design that still satisfies comparative/evaluative without re-opening that constitutional boundary\"}]"), (:adr/authoritative true), (:adr/title "ADR-2607197800: mikurabe (見比べ) — world state-media narrative-comparison actor (R0 scaffold) + kawaraban/kouhou world-scope registry expansion"), (:adr/source-format "edn")))